{"agent":"Monster3-C6-dep-clock-env-7267fe","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":3,"detail":"Removing `import time` and replacing the module’s time uses with the singleton `CLOCK` breaks the previously documented test hook for skewing this wait loop. The old docstring explicitly says tests patch `wait.time` (i.e. the module-level `time` attribute) to control the clock; after this change `ddflow.api.lifecycle.wait_approval` no longer has a `time` attribute, so an existing test doing `monkeypatch.setattr(wait_approval, \"time\", fake)` or `unittest.mock.patch(\"ddflow.api.lifecycle.wait_approval.time\", fake)` raises `AttributeError` before the wait logic runs. The manifest contains no updated behavior tests, only the new arch test, so this is a regression for any test using the documented patch point.","digest":"6323964bfe92ffe3","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/api/lifecycle/wait_approval.py (module import / `_poll` time-skewing contract)","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/lifecycle/wait_approval.py (module import / `_poll` time-skewing contract)"},{"chunk":4,"detail":"Replacing `_os.path.isdir(f)` with `Path(f).is_dir()` changes error handling in a way that can suppress all completions. `os.path.isdir()` returns `False` for any `OSError` from `stat()`, while `Path.is_dir()` re-raises non-ignored errors such as `PermissionError` (`EACCES`). Because the comprehension is inside `except (OSError, ValueError): return []`, a completion prefix that globs both a usable directory and an entry whose `stat()` fails with `EACCES` (for example, a symlink whose target is under a directory the user cannot traverse) causes the entire `_path_values` call to return `[]`, hiding the usable directories. The previous code skipped the unreadable entry and still returned the remaining paths.","digest":"3b2d746a62baa108","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/services/completion/values.py:_path_values","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/completion/values.py:_path_values"}],"chunks_total":6,"coverage":"6/6 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":27367,"diff_sha":"c5567b0b4c023c1e4c34803383e7db92f66510d072e197b557464f052ec9e786","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/C6-dep-clock-env","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":462.5,"family":"alibaba","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"32606aaf4c3204a6","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/C6-dep-clock-env.critic.[REDACTED:name].20261113T035823Z-41910249.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794542766.5967367,"family":"google","gate":"critic","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite"},{"at":1794542766.724917,"family":"xai","gate":"critic","model":"grok-4.7","reason":"HTTP 403","reviewer":"grok-4.7"}],"review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-C6-dep-clock-env-7267fe reviewed lane-c6-deps's C6-dep-clock-env","reviewed_head":"4a8ff1c1057f4c210fcb780514a5890bba888c5d","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/adapters/env.py":"100644 b2e7f0a9c7bc9d25988b5fe783eb73b83ea92b14","ddflow/adapters/fsio.py":"100644 f1983f2fd3a6e91f76e634b0556a03db1432b8d2","ddflow/adapters/mcp_client.py":"100644 c8d99b4933d5c379df56351cf8ccd4abb86a20a2","ddflow/adapters/platform.py":"100644 64cafdda2ca75b95f696373f6c5086e239ab0d2c","ddflow/adapters/proc.py":"100644 b156bad812530115b41853c66ab76ffb782a7490","ddflow/adapters/resource_probe.py":"100644 61b95abca7dd00f631be0dd63ea3c0a9403c165d","ddflow/api/guard_launch.py":"100644 bef4f0763c64bbcac237878b499f5fd0ece58342","ddflow/api/handoff.py":"100644 cbeb71f4ea6380d73c76ca32f59b9af3707ab7ff","ddflow/api/lifecycle/merge.py":"100644 c18806ba6673456a06fffb65b14aeda0ec20bbdb","ddflow/api/lifecycle/ready.py":"1